# Local development only: copy to .env (ignored by git and by docker builds) and set, for docker compose:
#   POSTGRES_PASSWORD (required) - any local-only value for the compose database; the API receives it too.
#   APP_PORT (optional) - the host port of the app on 127.0.0.1, default 8080.
# Never commit real values. Automated runs set these in the environment instead of using this file.
